From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:56:11 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Sign in: close the scan window before the Switch staff
 sheet under it

Scanning a pass closed both windows in the same moment. On iOS that can
leave an invisible window over the screen, so nothing could be pressed,
not even Skip or Exit in a training Guide. The scan window now slides
away first and the sheet closes half a second later.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HPQ9oSxZtSS6NJ2n35ECXG
